 self._mgr.round(decimals=decimals)\n2505 |         return self._constructor_from_mgr(new_mgr, axes=new_mgr.axes).__finalize__(\n2506 |             self, method=\"round\"\n2507 |         )\n```\n\nFound function `pandas/core/series.py:Series.pop`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n5097 | def pop(self, item: Hashable) -> Any:\n5098 |         \"\"\"\n5099 |         Return item and drops from series. Raise KeyError if not found.\n5100 | \n5101 |         Parameters\n5102 |         ----------\n5103 |         item : label\n5104 |             Index of the element that needs to be removed.\n5105 | \n5106 |         Returns\n5107 |         -------\n5108 |         scalar\n5109 |             Value that is popped from series.\n5110 | \n5111 |         See Also\n5112 |         --------\n5113 |         Series.drop: Drop specified values from Series.\n5114 |         Series.drop_duplicates: Return Series with duplicate values removed.\n5115 | \n5116 |         Examples\n5117 |         --------\n5118 |         >>> ser = pd.Series([1, 2, 3])\n5119 | \n5120 |         >>> ser.pop(0)\n5121 |         1\n5122 | \n5123 |         >>> ser\n5124 |         1    2\n5125 |         2    3\n5126 |         dtype: int64\n5127 |         \"\"\"\n5128 |         return super().pop(item=item)\n```\n\nFound function `pandas/core/frame.py:DataFrame.round`.\nFound function `pandas/core/internals/blocks.py:Block.round`.\nFound function `pandas/core/internals/managers.py:BaseBlockManager.round`.\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/masked.py:BaseMaskedArray.round`.\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/datetimelike.py:TimelikeOps.round`.\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/arrow/array.py:ArrowExtensionArray.round`.\nFound function `pandas/core/indexes/range.py:RangeIndex.round`.\nFound function `pandas/core/indexes/base.py:Index.round`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `round`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n"}, {"content": "<function=get_en